        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global ED-VR531-AL Surface Vertical Rod Alarm Exit Device</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSurface mounted vertical rod touch bar rim exit device with alarm is for use on hollow metal or wood doors where there is no projection on the door face. A Grade 1 (Highest Grade) Touch Bar Rim Exit Device, sutiable for heavy duty industrial  and commercial doors. For use on single or double door applications. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese alarm vertical rod exit devices are <b>non-handed for 36\" wide doors</b>. The latches, springs and (2) guides are made from long lasting high strength stainless steel. These exit devices are listed by U.L./U.L.C. and comply with U.L. 10C and UBC 7-2 (1997) for positive pressure.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor 36\" wide doors it comes packaged with a EAK500 Alarm Kit. EMERGENCY-EXIT ONLY, ALARM WILL SOUND sticker is included (field applied).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Global ED-ED531ALARM-AL Alarm Exit Device:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Powder Coated Steel push bar, stainless steel springs</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Aluminum</b></li>\r\n<li>Latch: Top pullman type, Bottom bolt assembly</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Rods: 1/2\" OD round tubing.</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\" Will cover 161 door prep.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Top - surface mounted rim type, Bottom - flat round mortise or into threshold</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stile: 3\" minimum</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Reversible, non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" up to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Width: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Height: 7' standard. Add <a href=\"/products/1-foot-vertical-rod-extension-glo-ed-rod12\"><b>ED-ROD12 1 Foot Extension</b></a> for 8' doors.</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Height: Recommended installation at 40\" from finished floor to center line of push rail</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: Furnished with sheet metal and machine screws</li>\r\n<li>Dogging: 1/2\" of a turn 7/32\" hex key</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed: 12PJ SA 32524</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Fire Rating: Available Option</li> -->\r\n<li>ANSI A156.3 Grade 1</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 1 Year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Alarm Features</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Microprocessor-based alarm board</li>\r\n<li>Includes <a href=\"/products/1-1-4-inch-mortise-cylinder-lock\">key mortise lock</a> to activate or inactivate the alarm</li>\r\n<li>When armed, alarm sounds immediately upon rail depression</li>\r\n<li>Free entry allowed based on exterior trim being used</li>\r\n<li>Battery powered (9V battery - not included)</li>\r\n<li>Alarm volume 103 dB at 8 feet</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Field adjustable Alarm time: 15, 30, 60 or 120 seconds</li> -->\r\n<li>UL Listed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Surface Vertical Rod Alarm Exit Device, Global ED-VR531ALARM-AL",
                "description": "Global ED-VR531ALARM-AL alarm exit device. Surface mounted vertical rod touch bar rim exit device with alarm is for use on hollow metal or wood doors where there is no projection on the door face. A Grade 1 (Highest Grade) Touch Bar Rim Exit Device, sutiable for heavy duty industrial  and commercial doors. For use on single or double door applications. It fits 36 inch doors. It comes packaged with a EAK500 Alarm Kit.",
